  <context>
    <background>
      Batch contents (inventory §9 "SpaarkeAi page" + migration-map start-now list):
      (1) the Insights renderer cluster (~14 files + their tests) under `src/solutions/SpaarkeAi/src/` — never wired, R5-origin (PR #345), superseded by R6 Pillar 5;
      (2) `notificationContextLoader.ts` (self-declared dead);
      (3) the Pillar-6b trio `SendToWorkspaceButton`, `PinToMatterButton`, `AddToAssistantToggle` — built + tested, zero importers (+ their tests);
      (4) `ChatHistoryPanel.tsx` (SpaarkeAi wrapper);
      (5) vestigial references to the above in `WorkspacePane` / `ConversationPane` (reference-site edits only).
    </background>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="none" status="complete">No dependencies — rides wave W-P0-B.</dependency>
